<H2>Introducing mod_python</H2>by <A=20
href=3D"http://onlamp.com/pub/au/1304">Gregory =
Trubetskoy</A><BR>10/02/2003=20
<P>Back in January I was asked to write an article about <A=20
href=3D"http://www.modpython.org/">mod_python</A>. I thought it was a =
great idea,=20
but the realities of life have kept me from being able to devote the =
necessary=20
effort to writing about mod_python, as all of my free time was devoted =
to=20
writing mod_python itself.</P><!--ONJava MPU Ad -->
